{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>Like a fetter</b> — like תעכסנה, meaning they will see the fetters, and they resemble chains. And likewise the meaning: <b>like a fetter</b> — just as the fool is hard to bring his foot into it, so he is hard to bring to discipline."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 7, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:21:20.110436586Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}